# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This dashboard needs NO environment variables to run.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep this file as a template if you ever add one. Copy it to `.env`
# (which is git-ignored) and fill in real values locally. Never commit `.env`.
#
# Netlify Blobs, used by netlify/functions/sync.mjs, is available to Functions
# automatically on a deployed site — it needs no key, token or URL here.
#
# Example of a value you might add later:
# SYNC_STORE_NAME=rr-sync
